      "role": "user",
      "content": "deep breaths and music dont really work anymore. it feels like even when i'm in a dark room, the static is still in my head. it's not just noise, it's like a heavy weight that won't let me rest. i feel like i'm constantly vibrating with stress and i can't turn it off. like... no matter what i do, there's always something more. i just want a version of silent that actually lasts. like a real, deep quiet that isn't just a temporary break.",
